              "text": "4 individual players."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Standard 52-card deck. Ranking: A (High) to 2 (Low)."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Standard 52-card deck. Ranking: A (High) to 2 (Low)."
